HOW TO APPLY:
================================================================================

1. Open dashboard.html in your code editor
2. Make the 3 changes above
3. Save the file
4. Clear browser localStorage to test fresh (optional):
   - Open DevTools (F12)
   - Go to Application > Local Storage
   - Delete the 'dojo_history' key
5. Refresh the page
6. Complete a typing test
7. Your score should now appear in the Dojo History table!

